# --- Type and genus ---
Quantization is a concept.
Quantization is a compression-technique.

# --- Mechanism (what it does) ---
Quantization reduces a parameter-precision.
Quantization reduces a model-size.
Quantization increases an inference-speed.
Quantization reduces an accuracy.
A large-language-model stores a parameter.
Quantization replaces a float with an integer.
Quantization rounds a parameter.

# --- Quantitative result (headline tradeoff, INT4 typical) ---
Quantization has a size-reduction-factor that is 4.
Quantization has an inference-speedup-factor that is 2.
Quantization has a minimum-accuracy-loss that is 5.
Quantization has a maximum-accuracy-loss that is 10.

# --- Precision formats (bytes per parameter) ---
Quantization includes Fp32.
Fp32 is a precision-format.
Fp32 has a byte-per-parameter that is 4.
Quantization includes Fp16.
Fp16 is a precision-format.
Fp16 has a byte-per-parameter that is 2.
Fp16 is training-standard.
Quantization includes Bf16.
Bf16 is a precision-format.
Bf16 has a byte-per-parameter that is 2.
Bf16 is training-standard.
Quantization includes Int8.
Int8 is a precision-format.
Int8 has a byte-per-parameter that is 1.
Quantization includes Int4.
Int4 is a precision-format.
Int4 has a byte-per-parameter that is 0.5.
Int4 is-used-for a local-model-deployment.

# --- Quantization formats ---
Quantization includes Gguf.
Gguf is a quantization-format.
Quantization includes Gptq.
Gptq is a quantization-format.
Quantization includes Awq.
Awq is a quantization-format.

# --- Model examples ---
Qwen3-Coder-Next is a foundation-model.
Qwen3-Coder-Next has a parameter-count that is 80000000000.
Qwen3-Coder-Next has an unquantized-size that is 159.4.
Qwen3-Coder-Next runs-on a laptop.
A frontier-model has a parameter-count that is 1000000000000.
A frontier-model has a ram-requirement that is 2.

# --- Why it matters (deployment and benefits) ---
Quantization enables a consumer-hardware-deployment.
Quantization enables a local-model-deployment.
Quantization enables a workstation-deployment.
Quantization enables a local-inference.
Quantization reduces an api-cost.
Quantization reduces a latency.
Quantization enables an open-weight-model.
Qwen3 is an open-weight-model.
Llama is an open-weight-model.

# --- Local and offline agent feasibility ---
Quantization enables an offline-agent.
Quantization enables a local-agent.
Quantization enables a hardware-aware-model-selection.
A gemma-model runs-on Apple-Silicon.
A gemma-model runs-with Mlx.
A browser-local-agent runs a quantized-model.

